WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.000 line:-2
<v President Lyndon B. Johnson>This act flows from a clear and simple wrong.

2
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:13.400 line:-2
<v President Lyndon B. Johnson>Its only purpose is to right that wrong.

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.900 line:-2
<v President Lyndon B. Johnson>Millions of Americans are denied

4
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.300 line:-2
<v President Lyndon B. Johnson>the right to vote because of their color.

5
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.400 line:-2
<v President Lyndon B. Johnson>This law will ensure them the right to vote.

6
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:34.300 line:-2
<v President Lyndon B. Johnson>The wrong is one which no American,

7
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:38.500 line:-2
<v President Lyndon B. Johnson>in his heart, can justify.

8
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.600 line:-2
<v President Lyndon B. Johnson>The right is one which no American,

9
00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:49.600 line:-2
<v President Lyndon B. Johnson>true to our principles, can deny.
